g your income — workers\' compensation should cover your lost wages if you cannot perform modified duty. I am going to write specific work restrictions today. If your employer can offer modified duty within those restrictions, you can return to work immediately in a limited capacity. If not, you are entitled to temporary total disability benefits. Our social worker can help you navigate the claims process.\'\n\n**6. Offer to coordinate with the surgeon**:\n\'If you would like, I am happy to call the surgeon\'s office so we can align our recommendations and make sure we are all on the same page. You should not have to manage conflicting advice — that is our job.\'\n\n**Key principles demonstrated**: Validating concerns, clarifying perceived provider disagreement, educating about shared decision-making, providing a concrete timeline with milestones, addressing psychosocial concerns (financial stress), offering direct inter-provider communication.',
